  "solution": "Mặt cầu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có tâm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và bán kính <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>54</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhoảng cách từ tâm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đến mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> được tính theo công thức:\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>r</mi></semantics></math> là bán kính đường tròn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có mối liên hệ giữa bán kính mặt cầu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>R</mi></semantics></math>, khoảng cách <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và bán kính đường tròn giao tuyến <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>r</mi></semantics></math> như sau\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tThay các giá trị đã tính được, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>54</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>48</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy đáp án đúng là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.",
